e + N2 -> N+ + N + 2e (upper variant). Cross section: Song et al., J. Phys. Chem. Ref. Data 52, 023104 (2023), Table 10 sigma(N+ + N2++); linear ramp from 0 at E_th = 24.284 eV to the 30 eV point; held above 1000 eV (tail share 0.000 % at 45 eV, 0.017 % at 150 eV, 0.754 % at 255 eV). Threshold sensitivity vs ramp (table / envelope): T_e 3 eV -42.4/+74.7 %, T_e 5 eV -17.2/+23.7 %, T_e 10 eV -3.9/+4.4 %, T_e 20 eV -0.8/+0.9 %, T_e 30 eV -0.4/+0.4 %. Header 24.284 eV = appearance energy (minimum fixed sink; +16 eV kinetic-energy release is a sensitivity, not included). Maxwellian-integrated by abep_sim/rate_tables.py (scripts/build_n2_dissociative_ionization_table.py). Evidence level 4. Reaction set abep-n2n-0.4.
